      "content": "Feeling detached while uncovering a profound lineage can be incredibly unsettling. To start reclaiming a sense of control, focus on mastering the present moment and your immediate environment. Start small by setting firm personal boundaries and consistently following through on your own goals, regardless of what others believe. This inner conviction will form the bedrock of your perceived authority.",
