      "content": "To project that inherent weight, focus less on *telling* people your truth and more on how you *behave* when it's being lived. Cultivate an aura of knowing calmness; speak deliberately, choose your words carefully, and maintain unwavering eye contact. This quiet confidence signals that your decisions are rooted in something deeper than the daily conversation, commanding respect through your demeanor rather than explanations.",
      "source": "target",
